Third-party fonts bundled with Menzies Design Wash UI
=====================================================

Default Wash UI typefaces ship as latin woff2 files inside this package
(dist/assets via styles.css, plus OFL texts under dist/fonts/). You do not
need a separate Fontsource install for the library default look.

